WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.932 --> 00:00:21.418
"Bye, Have a great first day at your after-school program!"

2
00:00:21.758 --> 00:00:22.718
Mr. Frick said.

3
00:00:25.039 --> 00:00:27.220
He waved as Ethan walked into the gym.

4
00:00:34.096 --> 00:00:38.038
"You must be Ethan," Miss Shelly said with a big smile.

5
00:00:40.499 --> 00:00:41.980
"Welcome to Kids Central!"

6
00:00:46.382 --> 00:00:49.444
Ethan saw two girls sitting at the table, trading beads.

7
00:00:50.384 --> 00:00:51.825
They looked up and stared at him.

8
00:00:52.745 --> 00:00:55.627
Two boys were playing basketball in a corner of the gym.

9
00:00:56.407 --> 00:00:58.008
They stopped and stared at him too.

10
00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:04.141
"A new kid?"

11
00:01:04.541 --> 00:01:05.522
one of the boys said.

12
00:01:05.542 --> 00:01:08.725
"Ethan, meet Nina and Izzie.

13
00:01:09.445 --> 00:01:10.526
They're in third grade.

14
00:01:11.447 --> 00:01:13.408
And this is Bobby and Jason.

15
00:01:14.189 --> 00:01:15.710
They're in fourth grade, like you!"

16
00:01:16.071 --> 00:01:16.971
Miss Shelly said.

17
00:01:16.991 --> 00:01:21.535
"Ethan just moved from California," she told everyone.

18
00:01:21.555 --> 00:01:24.878
"Hi," the boys said together.

19
00:01:24.898 --> 00:01:28.401
"You're really tan," Jason said.

20
00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:32.324
"It's warm and sunny all year in southern California."

21
00:01:34.664 --> 00:01:36.666
Ethan looked out the window and frowned.

22
00:01:36.686 --> 00:01:38.427
"Not like here."

23
00:01:38.447 --> 00:01:42.610
"We’re going to make Kids Central scrapbooks today!"

24
00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:43.931
Miss Shelly said.

25
00:01:43.951 --> 00:01:48.855
"Every day we do a new activity together," she explained to Ethan.

26
00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:50.636
"It's fun!"

27
00:01:51.116 --> 00:01:51.777
said Nina.

28
00:01:51.797 --> 00:01:58.842
"Today we'll make scrapbooks that you can fill in during the year," Miss Shelly said.

29
00:01:58.862 --> 00:02:05.478
"First choose a long piece of construction paper for the front and back of your book.

30
00:02:06.258 --> 00:02:07.198
Fold it in half.

31
00:02:08.239 --> 00:02:11.340
Then write the year and 'Kids Central' on the front."

32
00:02:12.701 --> 00:02:14.942
Jason and Bobby both chose orange.

33
00:02:15.822 --> 00:02:17.182
But Ethan chose blue.

34
00:02:17.202 --> 00:02:22.044
"Blue is my favorite color because it's the color of the ocean," Ethan said.

35
00:02:22.064 --> 00:02:26.466
"In California I used to surf every day after school!"

36
00:02:27.467 --> 00:02:28.187
He paused.

37
00:02:29.047 --> 00:02:30.768
"But there's no ocean in Pennsylvania."

38
00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:36.362
"But Pennsylvania has other fun things," Bobby said.

39
00:02:36.382 --> 00:02:43.306
"Now choose six pieces of the smaller paper for the inside pages," Miss Shelly said.

40
00:02:43.326 --> 00:02:47.988
"Put them in your folded cover, and staple the folded side.

41
00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:53.912
Glue this All About Me sheet on the first page."

42
00:02:53.932 --> 00:02:57.894
"My favorite food is tacos!"

43
00:02:58.414 --> 00:02:59.135
Ethan said.

44
00:02:59.155 --> 00:03:01.636
"Will we make tacos at Kids Central?"

45
00:03:02.684 --> 00:03:04.665
"Yeah! Let's make tacos!"

46
00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:05.825
Izzie said.

47
00:03:05.845 --> 00:03:07.886
"Maybe we could.

48
00:03:08.787 --> 00:03:11.047
We do cook a lot," Miss Shelly said.

49
00:03:11.068 --> 00:03:17.830
"The next page will be your September page," Miss Shelly went on.

50
00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:23.613
"Use these alphabet stickers to spell 'September' across the top.

51
00:03:24.713 --> 00:03:28.975
This month you can draw pictures or write about what happened in school."

52
00:03:28.995 --> 00:03:34.950
"I'm going to write about Ethan, the new boy with blue shorts," Izzie said.

53
00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:37.031
She pointed at Ethan.

54
00:03:37.051 --> 00:03:41.033
"It is not nice to point, Izzie," Miss Shelly said.

55
00:03:41.053 --> 00:03:45.475
"I'll write about my first day at Kids Central," Ethan said.

56
00:03:45.495 --> 00:03:47.857
"Great ideas!

57
00:03:48.637 --> 00:03:52.959
Next make one page for each month until June," Miss Shelly said.

58
00:03:52.979 --> 00:03:56.321
"You can fill in the other pages during the year."

59
00:03:56.341 --> 00:03:59.943
"Miss Shelly, there's one extra page.

60
00:04:00.784 --> 00:04:01.344
What's it for?"

61
00:04:01.884 --> 00:04:02.765
Ethan asked.

62
00:04:04.245 --> 00:04:06.146
"It should be the Friends page.

63
00:04:07.367 --> 00:04:10.049
We can sign our names on each other's scrapbooks!"

64
00:04:10.469 --> 00:04:11.149
Bobby said.

65
00:04:11.169 --> 00:04:14.891
"Cool idea," Ethan said, smiling.

66
00:04:14.911 --> 00:04:16.752
"Will you sign mine?"

67
00:04:16.772 --> 00:04:19.934
"Sure," Bobby said.

68
00:04:19.954 --> 00:04:23.596
"Gather together, everyone.

69
00:04:24.477 --> 00:04:28.319
We're going to take a photo for your scrapbooks," Miss Shelly said.

70
00:04:28.339 --> 00:04:30.380
"It will go on the cover."

71
00:04:31.369 --> 00:04:32.792
The kids gathered together.

72
00:04:33.634 --> 00:04:35.619
Miss Shelly set the timer on the camera.

73
00:04:36.401 --> 00:04:38.345
She ran behind them just in time.
